        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《此间相》交流群：《此间相》官方群加入 QQ 662389358</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————————————————————————————————————————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/2419e5dbfeb88c68446bfaf8c010ff6c.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/2419e5dbfeb88c68446bfaf8c010ff6c.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >寒冬深夜，大学生安和与死党叁添为找回误交的情书，潜入校园，却意外翻出一张血迹斑斑的人皮傩面。面具内侧刻着诡谲的符咒——“以汝之魂，祭吾之生”。触碰的瞬间，安和额角撕裂般剧痛，金色瞳孔骤然睁开，窥见了超自然的恐惧：  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >办公室的墙壁渗出鲜血，窗外的尸体倒吊着凝视他们，脸上赫然戴着同样的傩面。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/f2ab5869f1f0de5634507d85d8699192.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/f2ab5869f1f0de5634507d85d8699192.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 寻找真相途中，被卷入一场跨越千年的诅</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/10b607f02d1fed0d757718feb97c367d.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/10b607f02d1fed0d757718feb97c367d.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 孩童在破庙前跪拜黄金神像，贡品竟是腐烂的人头；  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 老妇缩在柴房啃食野菜，脖颈的刀痕渗出黑血；  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 守夜人倒立行走，面具下的脸早已腐烂成骨。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/f970277fc4cbb75ac01e43c1eaf74b2d.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/f970277fc4cbb75ac01e43c1eaf74b2d.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诡异既是诅咒的源头，也是反抗宿命的觉醒者。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/a0730a443de67540423bccc306f69401.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/a0730a443de67540423bccc306f69401.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金瞳化为灰烬，躯体成为镇压傩面的“活碑”；若堕落，则额生盘角，在祭坛上接受万鬼朝拜。  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/e8c35177fc57f9a4e78378e9c7e68205.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/e8c35177fc57f9a4e78378e9c7e68205.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——当神谕即是谎言，你能否在疯狂中守住最后的人性？—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/fa4f55b8b14ad2670781ccca5ea84707.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/fa4f55b8b14ad2670781ccca5ea84707.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/16322504d857adb3f307ea916e857da7.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/16322504d857adb3f307ea916e857da7.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=912 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>谢安和</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >表面玩世不恭，内心敏锐细腻。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因帮好友叁添寻回情书，意外触发傩面诅咒，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >额角长出象征“通灵之眼”的金色瞳孔，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >逐渐窥见阴阳两界的诡谲真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/8b37aa72d132c6ee40d8737ab58438b2.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/8b37aa72d132c6ee40d8737ab58438b2.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=912 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>石叁添</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因误交情书引发连锁灾难。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >看似胆小怕事，却愿为兄弟两肋插刀。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >对姚瑶抱有暗恋，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >情书事件引爆傩面苏醒，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >愧疚感驱使其追随安和深入险境。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/32313b447b06d205012d08275353a50d.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/32313b447b06d205012d08275353a50d.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=912 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>姚瑶</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >父亲因诅咒消失世间。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >发现安和与父亲消失原因有相似点</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >表面是完美女神，实则背负家族血债。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为寻找父亲真相加入探险，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >逐渐发现事情的真相。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/28e2e45e06260ec5dd52f0ff2f16fa03.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/28e2e45e06260ec5dd52f0ff2f16fa03.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=912 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>徐散</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >姚瑶小叔，随身携带兄长的遗物相机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为保护侄女一同前往青川。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >知晓当年失踪事件的部分真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras/fdfb9828484dd6633faeceb7f64b92a1.avif?t=1767172882\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631890/extras_big/fdfb9828484dd6633faeceb7f64b92a1.avif?t=1767172882 width=800 height=912 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>依儿</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >青川村的“幽灵少女”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>见</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >——当面具摘下，你能否直视皮囊下的真实？——</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏内容简短介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶全剧情约6.5万字文本，包含大量大小不同cg特写，可供游玩3~5h</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶结局包括4个be，1个he，1个ne。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶游戏内含有灵异恐怖、死亡、血腥、超自然元素，请按需酌情购买。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶游戏剧情极尽可能使游戏具有严密的推理性和逻辑性，已尽力 万分感谢各位玩家支持。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >关于制作组（staff团队）</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作组 万象重工《此间相》制作组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作人：庆之</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >美术组：卖画旅人 羽遥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >周边组/美宣：羽遥 卖画旅人</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >程序：神秘人</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >文案/游戏演出：月明 CY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >技术指导 ：舍长</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pv制作</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作组wb 万象重工game go </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >b站 万象重工game go </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >美术组b站 卖画旅人 默羽遥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家可以提供游戏反馈！非常感谢！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
